# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.
#
# Monorepo com dois workspaces standalone (web/, studio/ — seção 5 do
# AGENTS.md), cada um com seu próprio node_modules/build output. Padrões
# usam ** em vez de / para casar em qualquer nível.

# dependencies
**/node_modules
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
**/coverage

# next.js (web/)
web/.next/
web/out/
web/next-env.d.ts

# sanity studio (studio/)
studio/dist/
studio/.sanity/
studio/schema.json

# production
**/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (canonical list lives in each workspace's .env.example)
**/.env*
!web/.env.example
!studio/.env.example

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
**/*.tsbuildinfo
